+# Change:   CR-138-BRC07 · P4.3 — "A debtor read: bills, ladder state and
+#           history for one account." Blueprint `05-prototype/06 Payments Page
+#           Blueprint.pdf` p21 and screen **7·2 Debtor**, whose own task line
