med rather than left to be found** — `POST /customers/{id}/payments` (a multi-account tender) and the transfer path. Both are inside the ruling's spirit and neither was in front of you, so neither was changed. **Recommended: (a) plus widening the guard to those two doors**, so the rule is one sentence with one implementation. | product | LANE P2-API, 2026-09-23, building `P2.23` of `CR-136-BRC07` | **Nothing today — the ruling is built as given. It bites the first time a utility keys a mailed cheque, and the refusal will be correct-as-ruled and wrong-in-fact** | **CLOSED 2026-09-23** |
